WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.363
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.633 --> 00:30.051
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

3
01:10.967 --> 01:12.844
Secretary Yoon, you traitor…

4
01:12.927 --> 01:14.554
What did you just say?

5
01:15.597 --> 01:17.432
What happened?

6
01:20.435 --> 01:22.020
What happened to your face?

7
01:23.938 --> 01:25.857
I guess it means

8
01:26.900 --> 01:28.318
I'm not the traitor here.

9
01:38.786 --> 01:42.248
Did you lock them up? Keep them there until the event's over.

10
01:42.749 --> 01:44.751
Avoid direct contact with Na Bo-bae.

11
01:44.834 --> 01:45.793
Yes, sir.

12
01:45.877 --> 01:48.046
There are no electronic devices near her, right?

13
01:48.129 --> 01:49.547
Of course.

14
01:50.298 --> 01:53.259
There's nothing here, only rocks and trees.

15
01:53.343 --> 01:55.303
Don't worry. Just go on in.

16
01:55.887 --> 01:58.264
Understood, Director. Yes, sir.

17
02:01.142 --> 02:01.976
D

18
02:02.060 --> 02:04.354
MR. BAEK IS ON HIS WAY TO THE TS 30TH ANNIVERSARY PARTY

19
02:04.437 --> 02:05.647
NA BO-BAE AND YOON JAE-HO…

20
02:10.360 --> 02:13.071
NA BO-BAE AND YOON JAE-HO ARE BEING HELD ON DIRECTOR CHOI'S ORDERS

21
02:42.558 --> 02:45.061
The door won't open. What do we do?

22
02:46.104 --> 02:47.855
Damn it. We don't have our phones.

23
02:48.356 --> 02:50.733
Manager Yoon, what are you doing?

24
02:53.278 --> 02:56.114
My little sister is here.

25
02:58.658 --> 02:59.492
Sorry?

26
03:00.368 --> 03:03.788
This is where the memorial tablets for Mr. Baek's parents are kept.

27
03:05.581 --> 03:06.791
My sister

28
03:07.917 --> 03:08.918
is here too.

29
03:12.046 --> 03:13.464
They locked us in here.

30
03:15.216 --> 03:17.385
Director Choi must be behind this.

31
03:18.261 --> 03:19.679
Your sister

32
03:21.306 --> 03:22.598
passed away?

33
03:40.199 --> 03:41.868
It's okay, Jae-ho.

34
03:41.951 --> 03:44.704
My mom and dad sent them. They're worried about me.

35
03:44.787 --> 03:47.373
Oh, really?

36
03:47.457 --> 03:49.542
Okay, let's try this one.

37
03:49.625 --> 03:50.543
Yeah!

38
03:51.336 --> 03:55.006
Jae-yeong was first in line for a heart transplant,

39
03:55.089 --> 03:57.216
but the TS chairman's grandson took her place.

40
03:57.300 --> 04:01.137
-My goodness. -Those TS bastards!

41
04:01.220 --> 04:04.223
Jae-yeong died because of them!

42
04:04.974 --> 04:09.562
Jae-yeong was first in line.

43
04:21.282 --> 04:22.116
Get lost.

44
04:23.242 --> 04:26.120
Don't you know Jae-yeong died because of you?

45
04:26.204 --> 04:27.622
You think money is everything?

46
04:27.705 --> 04:29.207
It wasn't because of me.

47
04:29.290 --> 04:31.000
My dad told me.

48
04:31.084 --> 04:35.254
Jae-yeong was supposed to get the heart transplant.

49
04:36.381 --> 04:37.715
But you took it from her.

50
04:38.216 --> 04:40.635
No, I have an artificial heart.

51
04:41.886 --> 04:44.639
-I'm not getting a heart transplant. -What?

52
04:44.722 --> 04:46.641
Professor Jang told me

53
04:47.308 --> 04:49.852
your sister got sick before she could get a transplant.

54
04:50.937 --> 04:53.272
He said that's why she went to heaven.

55
04:53.773 --> 04:55.566
It wasn't because of me.

56
04:55.650 --> 04:58.111
The ones who died because of me

57
04:58.194 --> 05:00.113
were my mom and dad.

58
05:00.613 --> 05:02.824
Not your sister.

59
05:03.408 --> 05:04.617
So

60
05:05.201 --> 05:08.037
Jae-yeong was going to die anyway?

61
05:09.372 --> 05:10.915
That's not fair.

62
05:11.666 --> 05:12.917
She was only 9.

63
05:14.585 --> 05:16.129
Mom…

64
05:20.550 --> 05:22.301
The day I lost my sister,

65
05:22.927 --> 05:25.054
Mr. Baek lost his parents.

66
05:28.099 --> 05:29.642
I was just a boy.

67
05:30.726 --> 05:32.228
I thought Mr. Baek and I

68
05:33.146 --> 05:35.106
had been brought together by fate.

69
05:35.898 --> 05:38.901
We both lost family on the same day.

70
05:39.986 --> 05:41.737
We were together when it happened.

71
05:53.583 --> 05:55.793
Ms. Na Bo-bae, why are you crying?

72
05:55.877 --> 05:58.004
It's just so sad.

73
05:59.714 --> 06:01.048
I feel so bad

74
06:01.966 --> 06:05.219
for your sister, Mr. Baek, and you.

75
06:06.762 --> 06:09.640
I'm sorry for suspecting you.

76
06:25.323 --> 06:26.657
Are you all right?

77
06:26.741 --> 06:29.619
I'll wash your handkerchief and give it back.

78
06:31.412 --> 06:33.331
These pockets are sewn shut.

79
06:34.123 --> 06:35.708
Give it to me later.

80
06:35.791 --> 06:37.835
I'll wash it and give it back.

81
06:37.919 --> 06:39.462
Just throw it away.

82
06:43.466 --> 06:44.592
We need to hurry.

83
06:44.675 --> 06:47.803
I haven't seen Mr. Baek since morning. He needs a charge.

84
06:48.387 --> 06:51.432
As far as I know, he's good for 25 hours.

85
06:51.516 --> 06:53.226
Or at least 24.

86
06:53.309 --> 06:56.187
Yes, but I've got a bad feeling.

87
06:56.270 --> 06:58.231
We should hurry and get out of here.

88
07:24.131 --> 07:26.634
Seriously? I ordered it ages ago!

89
07:27.677 --> 07:31.222
Yes, turn right at the intersection and keep going.

90
07:31.305 --> 07:32.932
You'll see a temple.

91
07:34.392 --> 07:37.353
Secretary Lee! Over here!

92
07:37.436 --> 07:39.689
Manager Yoon, are you all right?

93
07:42.066 --> 07:43.150
I'm sorry about this.

94
07:43.859 --> 07:47.863
Just to be clear, I don't have anything personal against either of you.

95
07:47.947 --> 07:51.284
I'm just a lowly employee earning a paycheck.

96
07:51.367 --> 07:55.830
I had no choice but to follow orders and bring you here.

97
08:00.084 --> 08:01.627
I had my suspicions,

98
08:01.711 --> 08:04.088
but I can't believe Secretary Lee was a spy.

99
08:05.506 --> 08:06.882
All this time,

100
08:07.925 --> 08:10.553
you were a spy planted by Director Choi?

101
08:11.137 --> 08:12.138
Yeah, pretty much.

102
08:12.722 --> 08:15.349
I happen to need a lot of money.

103
08:16.767 --> 08:18.102
It pays to play both sides.

104
08:20.187 --> 08:21.397
Are you telling me

105
08:21.897 --> 08:24.317
you were also spying for Director Han?

106
08:24.400 --> 08:27.153
They say it's easy to miss what's right under your nose.

107
08:27.987 --> 08:30.865
Today's probably the day, don't you think?

108
08:32.283 --> 08:34.493
Since Choi Do-yoon and Han Seol-hee

109
08:34.577 --> 08:36.579
are both with Mr. Baek now.

110
08:36.662 --> 08:40.750
Secretary Lee, what are you talking about?

111
08:40.833 --> 08:43.502
It means today's probably the end

112
08:43.586 --> 08:45.171
for Mr. Baek.

113
08:45.254 --> 08:46.422
What?

114
08:47.089 --> 08:48.007
The end?

115
08:49.091 --> 08:50.051
Secretary Lee.

116
08:50.134 --> 08:52.303
You fucking bastard!

117
08:52.386 --> 08:55.181
Oh dear. There's that temper of yours again.

118
08:55.264 --> 08:59.143
I'm too scared to even talk to you now.

119
08:59.226 --> 09:02.605
-Lee! -His whole family's in there, right?

120
09:02.688 --> 09:04.148
When Mr. Baek passes,

121
09:04.231 --> 09:07.401
I'll place his memorial tablet right next to his family's.

122
09:08.152 --> 09:08.986
Open the door.

123
09:10.529 --> 09:11.697
Open the door!

124
09:11.781 --> 09:13.699
You won't get away with this!

125
09:21.832 --> 09:22.875
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

126
09:23.668 --> 09:24.543
Why is…

127
09:24.627 --> 09:25.920
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

128
09:27.421 --> 09:29.215
What's going on?

129
09:30.174 --> 09:31.300
What's happening?

130
09:31.384 --> 09:32.343
Damn it.

131
09:33.761 --> 09:34.595
Ow, it's hot!

132
09:38.140 --> 09:39.141
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

133
09:39.225 --> 09:41.727
Why is everyone always out to get him?

134
09:43.396 --> 09:45.064
What did he ever do to anyone?

135
09:48.317 --> 09:49.944
Ms. Na Bo-bae, are you okay?

136
09:50.986 --> 09:53.114
Buddha, Avalokiteśvara.

137
09:53.197 --> 09:55.408
Please forgive this poor soul just this once.

138
09:59.370 --> 10:00.454
What are you doing?

139
10:00.538 --> 10:01.706
Metal is a conductor.

140
10:03.499 --> 10:05.626
And so is this lock.

141
10:06.210 --> 10:07.712
A strong current

142
10:07.795 --> 10:09.463
will make it spark.

143
10:17.555 --> 10:19.223
What the hell is this?

144
10:19.306 --> 10:22.685
I'm gonna get electrocuted. I need to stay calm.

145
10:23.686 --> 10:24.770
What is this?

146
10:24.854 --> 10:26.272
Secretary Na! What the hell?

147
10:26.355 --> 10:28.941
When did you… Stop! You'll break the door!

148
10:29.525 --> 10:31.944
I can't let you out, Secretary Na!

149
10:32.027 --> 10:33.320
Ow, it's hot!

150
10:33.988 --> 10:35.114
Fire!

151
10:35.197 --> 10:37.616
It's on fire! It's hot!

152
10:38.826 --> 10:40.453
This is on fire too!

153
10:44.457 --> 10:46.083
Fire!

154
10:47.460 --> 10:48.502
Get them! Hurry!

155
10:48.586 --> 10:49.920
What are you doing? Hurry!

156
10:51.630 --> 10:52.548
I'm sorry.

157
10:53.674 --> 10:54.759
Ms. Na Bo-bae!

158
10:56.761 --> 10:58.637
Stop them!

159
11:06.479 --> 11:07.480
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

160
11:16.781 --> 11:19.658
Our car's not here. I think these are all theirs.

161
11:24.371 --> 11:25.748
I'm here with a delivery.

162
11:25.831 --> 11:28.417
Did the temple really order fried chicken?

163
11:28.501 --> 11:29.794
Oh, yes.

164
11:29.877 --> 11:31.837
Just keep going straight up.

165
11:31.921 --> 11:34.173
Okay. Thank you.

166
11:40.679 --> 11:41.931
Excuse me.

167
11:42.014 --> 11:43.766
This is for you.

168
11:44.266 --> 11:45.768
Feel free to contact me.

169
11:45.851 --> 11:47.561
You must be in a hurry.

170
11:48.229 --> 11:49.146
Go ahead.

171
11:57.363 --> 11:58.614
Excuse me!

172
11:58.697 --> 12:01.367
Excuse me! Wait! Hey!

173
12:05.996 --> 12:09.500
And now, to mark TS Group's 30th anniversary,

174
12:09.583 --> 12:13.629
we'll hear from each division head about their achievements.

175
12:14.129 --> 12:18.676
Let's welcome Senior Managing Director Baek Ho-rang from TS Resort to the stage.

176
12:35.442 --> 12:37.027
Go faster!

177
12:43.075 --> 12:45.536
First, I'd like to…

178
12:50.291 --> 12:55.671
thank you all for joining us to celebrate TS Group's 30th anniversary.

179
13:57.274 --> 13:59.234
Call an ambulance.

180
14:00.486 --> 14:03.405
No photos. No photos, please!

181
14:04.698 --> 14:06.700
Out of the way. Step back.

182
14:06.784 --> 14:08.202
No photos!

183
14:08.285 --> 14:09.536
-Mr. Baek Ho-rang! -Sir!

184
14:11.497 --> 14:12.831
No photos!

185
14:13.332 --> 14:14.249
Sir!

186
14:14.750 --> 14:16.627
Mr. Baek Ho-rang?

187
14:18.379 --> 14:19.254
No.

188
14:19.338 --> 14:21.507
-Don't die. Breathe, please. -Hey, you!

189
14:21.590 --> 14:24.385
-Put that camera down! No photos! -Please clear the area!

190
14:24.468 --> 14:26.053
-Please leave! -Please step back.

191
14:26.136 --> 14:27.429
-Step back! -No photos!

192
14:27.513 --> 14:29.515
-Step back now. -No.

193
14:29.598 --> 14:30.766
Don't die.

194
14:30.849 --> 14:32.101
Don't die on me.

195
14:32.184 --> 14:33.143
Please.

196
14:44.738 --> 14:47.032
Let's go. Come on.

197
14:47.741 --> 14:48.909
Let's get out of here.

198
14:52.913 --> 14:53.747
Please.

199
14:54.623 --> 14:55.833
Please…

200
14:56.542 --> 15:00.254
Take everything I have. Just wake up, please!

201
15:19.732 --> 15:21.358
Baek Ho…

202
15:25.779 --> 15:26.613
Sir.

203
15:27.322 --> 15:28.782
Sir?

204
15:29.783 --> 15:30.951
Sir.

205
16:16.789 --> 16:18.415
Are you out of your mind?

206
16:18.916 --> 16:20.793
Have you completely lost it?

207
16:20.876 --> 16:21.710
What?

208
16:22.544 --> 16:24.421
Worried Baek Ho-rang might die?

209
16:25.339 --> 16:27.591
Did you spike his drink to kill him?

210
16:54.368 --> 16:55.828
Sir.

211
17:06.588 --> 17:07.589
Seol-hee.

212
17:08.507 --> 17:09.466
Han Seol-hee.

213
17:10.259 --> 17:11.969
Don't act all innocent.

214
17:12.678 --> 17:16.140
We're on the same team. Why do you think I kidnapped Na Bo-bae?

215
17:16.807 --> 17:18.976
You think I did it to bring her to Baek Ho-rang?

216
17:19.059 --> 17:20.811
I told you to keep her away from him.

217
17:21.395 --> 17:22.813
Why did you have to hurt him?

218
17:22.896 --> 17:23.814
You will never

219
17:25.065 --> 17:27.109
take Na Bo-bae's place.

220
17:27.609 --> 17:29.611
Baek Ho-rang will die without Na Bo-bae.

221
17:29.695 --> 17:31.196
You saw it yourself.

222
17:31.280 --> 17:32.990
Na Bo-bae saved Baek Ho-rang.

223
17:33.907 --> 17:36.869
That woman is Baek Ho-rang's battery.

224
17:38.579 --> 17:41.248
-What the hell are you talking about? -You didn't know?

225
17:41.915 --> 17:43.125
Na Bo-bae

226
17:43.208 --> 17:45.836
can generate electricity.

227
17:46.753 --> 17:47.713
Zap!

228
17:48.714 --> 17:49.548
Are you drunk?

229
18:04.438 --> 18:06.064
Man, what the hell is going on?

230
18:06.815 --> 18:09.318
Mr. Baek was taken to the hospital.

231
18:09.401 --> 18:11.320
They even performed CPR on him.

232
18:12.487 --> 18:14.489
Our ads won't be affected, right?

233
18:15.199 --> 18:17.868
Someone collapsed, and you're worried about the ad?

234
18:17.951 --> 18:21.246
Come on, he's our client. Of course I'm worried.

235
18:21.330 --> 18:22.247
Oh, Director.

236
18:22.331 --> 18:23.624
-Hello. -Why are you…

237
18:24.208 --> 18:26.793
Oh, right. We said we'd discuss the script, right?

238
18:26.877 --> 18:28.295
-Yes. -Sorry, I forgot.

239
18:28.378 --> 18:30.714
I just need to make a quick call about Writer Na.

240
18:30.797 --> 18:32.507
You mean Writer Na Bo-bae?

241
18:33.550 --> 18:34.551
Did something happen?

242
18:34.635 --> 18:35.510
Just a sec.

243
18:36.303 --> 18:37.638
What's going on?

244
18:48.315 --> 18:50.025
Director Han Seol-hee?

245
19:00.285 --> 19:01.119
It must be hard.

246
19:02.704 --> 19:07.167
They say misfortune comes all at once, but this is a bit much, isn't it?

247
19:08.001 --> 19:08.835
Sorry?

248
19:08.919 --> 19:11.421
You've been through a lot lately.

249
19:12.172 --> 19:13.382
Didn't you find it odd?

250
19:14.508 --> 19:18.762
One misfortune after another, as if the whole world were against you.

251
19:20.389 --> 19:22.599
What are you talking about?

252
19:22.683 --> 19:25.394
I've learned that with money, power,

253
19:25.477 --> 19:27.271
and enough malice,

254
19:27.854 --> 19:29.856
you can make bad things happen.

255
19:33.944 --> 19:36.989
I could become your misfortune, Ms. Na Bo-bae.

256
19:38.448 --> 19:40.033
SHOCKING IDENTITY OF JI EUN-HO'S GIRL

257
19:40.117 --> 19:43.287
Editing and spreading the video of you and Ji Eun-ho.

258
19:43.370 --> 19:47.499
Helping you land a commercial, securing a slot for your drama…

259
19:47.582 --> 19:49.209
We're dropping Writer Na's drama?

260
19:49.293 --> 19:50.919
Orders from the top. Sorry.

261
19:51.712 --> 19:54.423
…and then canceling it when you thought you'd made it.

262
19:59.428 --> 20:01.263
My drama got canceled?

263
20:01.888 --> 20:04.099
You didn't know? You'll get a call soon.

264
20:05.142 --> 20:06.101
That reminds me.

265
20:06.184 --> 20:08.061
Your brother got hurt recently, right?

266
20:13.191 --> 20:16.737
It wasn't a coincidence that your brother ended up in the hospital.

267
20:17.362 --> 20:20.073
Yes. I just took care of it.

268
20:20.574 --> 20:22.743
I made sure not to hit him too hard.

269
20:22.826 --> 20:24.411
But I feel really guilty.

270
20:25.704 --> 20:27.205
I'll make it worth your while.

271
20:29.124 --> 20:29.958
Thank you.

272
20:43.180 --> 20:44.389
You do realize

273
20:45.265 --> 20:47.893
that everything you just said is a crime, right?

274
20:47.976 --> 20:49.770
-If I report you to the-- -Go ahead.

275
20:50.354 --> 20:51.646
It's okay.

276
20:51.730 --> 20:53.231
I have an expensive lawyer.

277
20:54.858 --> 20:57.027
I know people like you very well, Ms. Na.

278
20:57.944 --> 21:01.073
People who chase their dreams over money or power.

279
21:01.782 --> 21:03.950
Love, hope,

280
21:04.034 --> 21:05.202
justice.

281
21:06.203 --> 21:08.372
People who like that kind of sentimental stuff.

282
21:09.873 --> 21:11.666
I can give you all that.

283
21:13.710 --> 21:14.836
Luck, not misfortune.

284
21:16.505 --> 21:19.091
As long as you disappear from Mr. Baek's life.

285
21:19.966 --> 21:23.095
Why should I leave Mr. Baek because of someone like you?

286
21:25.764 --> 21:28.058
Because the one who should be by his side

287
21:29.434 --> 21:30.727
is me.

288
21:31.728 --> 21:33.605
I can help him.

289
21:34.189 --> 21:35.524
But you, Ms. Na Bo-bae?

290
21:36.483 --> 21:40.695
I have your whole life under my control.

291
21:41.863 --> 21:43.657
What can you even do for him?

292
21:55.919 --> 21:58.630
Wow, you're something else.

293
21:59.131 --> 22:01.550
So this is what you're really like.

294
22:02.342 --> 22:06.680
You see, writers like me go crazy for people like you.

295
22:07.931 --> 22:11.726
A backstabbing character with a twist. So three-dimensional.

296
22:12.561 --> 22:16.064
I never saw it coming. You're interesting, to say the least.

297
22:17.023 --> 22:20.026
-Don't you understand what's going on? -I understand perfectly.

298
22:21.778 --> 22:23.155
No wonder.

299
22:23.238 --> 22:26.700
Everything was going so well, then suddenly, it all fell apart.

300
22:27.284 --> 22:30.495
Yeah, someone orchestrated all this.

301
22:31.413 --> 22:32.456
But who?

302
22:33.915 --> 22:36.710
This pretty, sweet,

303
22:36.793 --> 22:39.129
demure, angelic little princess.

304
22:40.130 --> 22:43.091
Would you mind if I wrote a character based on you?

305
22:43.175 --> 22:45.844
You're trying so hard to pretend you're okay.

306
22:47.554 --> 22:50.182
I'm curious to see how long you can keep it up.

307
22:51.183 --> 22:53.059
I don't even know what I'm capable of.

308
23:12.621 --> 23:13.955
Manager Yoon.

309
23:22.297 --> 23:23.256
Are you all right?

310
23:25.300 --> 23:26.134
Yes.

311
23:27.135 --> 23:30.222
I'd never done anything like that. They said I passed out from exhaustion.

312
23:32.474 --> 23:34.351
He's still in surgery?

313
23:34.434 --> 23:36.144
Why is it taking so long?

314
23:36.728 --> 23:37.729
Don't worry.

315
23:40.357 --> 23:41.233
Mr. Baek is…

316
23:43.151 --> 23:45.529
He's your rubber glove of fate, right?

317
23:51.201 --> 23:52.118
He'll be all right.

318
23:54.829 --> 23:55.914
I hope so.

319
23:56.748 --> 23:58.208
SURGERY OVER

320
24:08.927 --> 24:10.554
Doctor, how is Mr. Baek Ho-rang?

321
24:11.888 --> 24:13.682
The surgery went well.

322
24:15.475 --> 24:16.893
Thank you, Professor.

323
24:16.977 --> 24:19.729
Ms. Na Bo-bae, can I have a word with you?

324
24:21.731 --> 24:24.150
I'll leave you two to it, then.

325
24:24.234 --> 24:25.569
Thank you.

326
24:28.989 --> 24:31.366
What's wrong? Did something happen?

327
24:31.449 --> 24:33.368
No, the surgery went well.

328
24:34.119 --> 24:36.413
We replaced his artificial heart battery

329
24:36.496 --> 24:39.499
and confirmed it can hold its charge after closing him up.

330
24:39.583 --> 24:42.794
He can move to a regular ward after a few days in intensive care.

331
24:45.255 --> 24:46.840
Then why did you want to…

332
24:47.507 --> 24:52.345
You came in with Ho-rang a while back and had some tests done, remember?

333
24:52.429 --> 24:55.307
-Yes. -I checked your medical records.

334
24:55.390 --> 24:58.101
You were hospitalized here before, weren't you?

335
24:59.102 --> 25:01.396
Back then, when you regained consciousness,

336
25:01.479 --> 25:02.314
you said

337
25:02.981 --> 25:05.442
you felt electricity running through your body.

338
25:05.942 --> 25:07.068
Is that true?

339
25:08.445 --> 25:09.362
Yes.

340
25:09.446 --> 25:15.619
If Ho-rang's battery was charged by the electricity running through you,

341
25:16.995 --> 25:18.038
I'm afraid

342
25:18.622 --> 25:19.789
you two

343
25:20.457 --> 25:23.877
can't have any more physical contact.

344
25:26.796 --> 25:28.715
Why not?

345
25:29.841 --> 25:34.137
I heard Ho-rang's battery was at 0% before he was brought in tonight.

346
25:35.972 --> 25:38.433
That means the electricity running through you

347
25:38.516 --> 25:40.560
was enough to revive him from cardiac arrest.

348
25:41.061 --> 25:45.857
Another strong current flowing through him could overload his artificial heart.

349
25:58.578 --> 26:00.038
This means

350
26:00.955 --> 26:02.123
that you could end up

351
26:03.750 --> 26:05.669
killing Ho-rang.

352
26:17.639 --> 26:18.973
It's strange.

353
26:21.726 --> 26:25.063
So many terrible things have happened to me lately.

354
26:28.024 --> 26:30.360
But more than the drama getting canceled,

355
26:31.486 --> 26:34.447
or my brother getting hurt because of me,

356
26:35.782 --> 26:38.827
or all that trouble caused by the rumors about Eun-ho and me…

357
26:41.496 --> 26:43.873
seeing Mr. Baek lying there hurts the most.

358
26:55.802 --> 26:57.345
Now, if he touches me,

359
26:58.138 --> 26:59.723
he could die.

360
27:02.016 --> 27:03.101
No.

361
27:03.852 --> 27:07.355
Just walking into his room could cause something to go wrong.

362
27:09.774 --> 27:12.318
Just like my life, which has gone completely wrong.

363
28:03.244 --> 28:04.496
It's okay.

364
28:07.707 --> 28:10.960
It's not like my life has ever gone smoothly.

365
28:14.672 --> 28:16.966
Nothing ever works out for me.

366
28:19.219 --> 28:21.596
And I was always alone anyway.

367
28:30.230 --> 28:31.648
CHARGING CONTRACT

368
28:38.905 --> 28:43.284
I was going to end up alone again anyway.

369
28:50.875 --> 28:52.168
So it's okay.

370
29:01.261 --> 29:02.178
Bo-bae.

371
29:04.305 --> 29:05.515
What are you doing here?

372
29:05.598 --> 29:08.393
I was worried about you, so I went to the hospital.

373
29:08.476 --> 29:10.770
They told me Mr. Baek was still unconscious,

374
29:10.854 --> 29:12.689
and you'd already been discharged.

375
29:14.691 --> 29:16.818
Director Yeom told me about your drama.

376
29:17.819 --> 29:18.653
Yeah.

377
29:19.237 --> 29:20.488
It's been canceled.

378
29:24.701 --> 29:25.618
Going somewhere?

379
29:26.452 --> 29:27.537
Just

380
29:29.038 --> 29:30.456
somewhere away from here.

381
29:30.540 --> 29:32.834
Your old place? Or back with your parents?

382
29:32.917 --> 29:33.751
Eun-ho…

383
29:35.587 --> 29:37.088
could you move?

384
29:37.881 --> 29:39.549
Where are you going?

385
29:40.800 --> 29:42.260
You're not giving up, are you?

386
29:42.343 --> 29:43.595
Wait, Bo-bae. Just wait.

387
29:44.971 --> 29:46.139
I'll do your drama.

388
29:46.639 --> 29:48.892
I spoke with Director Yeom about it.

389
29:48.975 --> 29:52.186
If we start casting and get a time slot with my name on it…

390
29:52.270 --> 29:53.771
Don't do that.

391
29:54.439 --> 29:56.900
I'm not doing it anymore. It doesn't matter.

392
29:58.484 --> 30:00.069
How can you say that?

393
30:00.653 --> 30:02.030
It's your drama.

394
30:02.530 --> 30:04.699
You're so close to your dream debut.

395
30:05.783 --> 30:06.910
How can it not matter?

396
30:06.993 --> 30:08.077
Just…

397
30:12.165 --> 30:13.583
Just let me go.

398
30:13.666 --> 30:16.044
Just leave me alone, please.

399
30:26.095 --> 30:27.096
I won't stop you.

400
30:28.723 --> 30:29.724
I'm sorry.

401
30:32.101 --> 30:34.437
Just do what your heart wants.

402
30:35.855 --> 30:36.898
Do that.

403
30:38.441 --> 30:39.776
That's all I'm asking.

404
31:08.554 --> 31:11.724
The video of Mr. Baek collapsing is spreading fast.

405
31:11.808 --> 31:16.104
There are rumors about his health, family illness, and even heart disease.

406
31:16.187 --> 31:18.356
There are also articles about Ms. Na Bo-bae.

407
31:18.439 --> 31:21.192
First, get all the videos and articles taken down.

408
31:21.275 --> 31:24.696
Then compile a list of every outlet that published them.

409
31:24.779 --> 31:28.324
Pull our ads from those outlets. Or sue for defamation.

410
31:28.408 --> 31:29.242
Get it done.

411
31:29.826 --> 31:30.952
Yes, ma'am.

412
31:32.412 --> 31:33.538
Is that girl

413
31:34.038 --> 31:35.456
Ho-rang's girlfriend?

414
31:35.540 --> 31:36.499
Oh.

415
31:37.125 --> 31:38.042
No.

416
31:39.168 --> 31:42.839
She was only with him to help recharge his heart.

417
31:42.922 --> 31:46.050
How should I put it? She's sort of a heart-care specialist.

418
31:46.134 --> 31:49.012
The surgery went well. They won't be seeing each other again.

419
31:49.929 --> 31:51.514
Tomorrow morning,

420
31:52.098 --> 31:54.183
leak that Choi Do-yoon is the heir to TS.

421
31:55.643 --> 31:58.646
It's too risky to go with Ho-rang right now.

422
31:59.272 --> 32:01.232
Yes, ma'am.

423
32:17.415 --> 32:18.374
Sir.

424
32:19.000 --> 32:20.293
You're awake.

425
32:20.793 --> 32:22.336
The surgery went well.

426
32:22.920 --> 32:24.088
It's been four days.

427
32:31.679 --> 32:32.597
Where's Ms. Na?

428
32:37.393 --> 32:38.436
Sir, no.

429
32:38.936 --> 32:40.897
You need to lie down.

430
32:41.397 --> 32:42.940
Sir, please.

431
32:46.778 --> 32:48.029
That can't be right.

432
32:49.363 --> 32:51.032
Why would Ms. Na Bo-bae…

433
32:52.450 --> 32:54.452
-Where would she go? -I don't know.

434
32:54.535 --> 32:57.747
The house and garage are empty. It seems she changed her number too.

435
32:57.830 --> 32:59.248
Sir, please.

436
32:59.791 --> 33:00.666
Move.

437
33:01.250 --> 33:03.544
Sir, please! Sir!

438
33:05.379 --> 33:06.464
Sir!

439
33:06.547 --> 33:10.176
Hey, why are you walking around? You should be in bed!

440
33:10.259 --> 33:12.136
Why can't I be with Ms. Na?

441
33:12.220 --> 33:14.263
It could be dangerous, okay?

442
33:14.347 --> 33:16.891
It could put a strain on your heart.

443
33:18.810 --> 33:22.271
That's just one possibility.

444
33:22.355 --> 33:23.981
One possibility?

445
33:24.482 --> 33:28.402
If there's even a 1% chance it could put your life at risk,

446
33:28.486 --> 33:30.404
then it's a no!

447
34:30.339 --> 34:34.594
CHARGING CONTRACT

448
34:41.058 --> 34:42.185
Just because of that…

449
34:44.478 --> 34:46.772
she left without saying anything?

450
34:54.739 --> 34:55.573
Sir.

451
34:57.742 --> 34:59.619
Did you find out where she went?

452
34:59.702 --> 35:01.454
I asked around.

453
35:01.996 --> 35:03.956
She isn't at the TV station.

454
35:04.457 --> 35:06.125
Her drama got canceled.

455
35:09.378 --> 35:12.089
Hire an investigator or call the police.

456
35:12.965 --> 35:14.467
Do whatever it takes to find her.

457
35:18.512 --> 35:21.015
Sir, you need to rest.

458
35:22.975 --> 35:25.394
We can look for Ms. Na Bo-bae anytime.

459
35:25.478 --> 35:27.480
You don't need to charge anymore.

460
35:28.314 --> 35:30.358
Take it easy.

461
35:34.737 --> 35:35.655
No.

462
35:37.031 --> 35:37.949
Forget it.

463
35:38.783 --> 35:40.493
I'll find her myself.

464
35:46.624 --> 35:48.876
I told you, she won't even answer my calls.

465
35:48.960 --> 35:52.964
I get why she's upset it got canceled. She worked on it for three years.

466
35:53.047 --> 35:56.259
But I didn't expect her to disappear. I'm upset about it too.

467
35:56.342 --> 35:59.595
So you have no idea where she might have gone?

468
35:59.679 --> 36:00.930
Not a clue.

469
36:01.013 --> 36:02.139
Bo-bae?

470
36:03.182 --> 36:06.143
I'm not sure. I haven't really been in touch with her.

471
36:06.227 --> 36:07.520
Why?

472
36:07.603 --> 36:08.771
Did she go somewhere?

473
36:08.854 --> 36:10.731
You really don't know where she is?

474
36:12.608 --> 36:15.278
Oh, I should get back to work.

475
36:15.361 --> 36:18.030
Yeah, I have to head back.

476
36:18.114 --> 36:20.741
If I hear from Bo-bae,

477
36:21.742 --> 36:24.704
I'll tell her to call you. Bye now, take care.

478
36:41.929 --> 36:45.599
Excuse me. They moved out.

479
36:46.309 --> 36:47.143
Sorry?

480
36:47.226 --> 36:49.228
The older sister's getting married,

481
36:49.812 --> 36:52.398
and her brother went home to look after their parents.

482
36:52.481 --> 36:54.608
No one lives there now.

483
37:40.279 --> 37:41.447
Okay.

484
37:42.156 --> 37:44.533
I will save you, Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

485
37:57.296 --> 37:59.048
You said you would save me.

486
38:04.553 --> 38:05.471
I

487
38:06.972 --> 38:08.849
feel like I'm going to die right now.

488
38:16.232 --> 38:17.733
Where are you?

489
38:20.236 --> 38:21.612
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

490
38:37.545 --> 38:38.629
Why's it so dark?

491
38:38.712 --> 38:40.798
Na Bo-bae!

492
38:42.049 --> 38:43.050
Hey.

493
38:43.717 --> 38:45.177
Na Bo-bae, are you okay?

494
38:45.261 --> 38:46.971
Yeah. I didn't see you.

495
38:47.054 --> 38:50.391
What the… Hey, you spilled all the water.

496
38:51.100 --> 38:53.644
Are you okay? Did you eat anything today?

497
38:54.353 --> 38:56.147
Why are you standing here in the dark?

498
38:56.230 --> 38:57.731
Oh, sorry.

499
38:59.233 --> 39:01.193
Is this because of Baek Ho-rang?

500
39:02.611 --> 39:05.072
No. It's not like that.

501
39:08.701 --> 39:10.953
-Actually, earlier-- -I'll clean this up.

502
39:13.706 --> 39:15.833
It's okay. Give it here, I'll do it.

503
39:20.254 --> 39:21.755
Are you okay?

504
39:21.839 --> 39:23.549
I should be asking you that.

505
39:23.632 --> 39:25.134
Get some rest. I'll do it.

506
39:25.217 --> 39:27.720
-But our hands just-- -Quiet, you. Seriously.

507
39:28.471 --> 39:31.348
Go on in and rest. I'll clean this up.

508
39:31.432 --> 39:34.268
Don't think about anything. Just go to sleep, okay?

509
39:35.102 --> 39:38.147
Don't worry about anything. I'll clean this up.

510
39:40.065 --> 39:41.150
Just now…

511
39:42.776 --> 39:44.945
Why didn't she get zapped?

512
40:06.634 --> 40:09.762
It's Seo-jeong. I'm sorry for calling this late.

513
40:23.275 --> 40:24.610
Na Bo-bae!

514
40:25.110 --> 40:27.446
I know you're here. Open the door.

515
40:28.822 --> 40:31.659
The studio was a lie, and so was the contract renewal.

516
40:31.742 --> 40:35.120
You quit the drama and ran off to stay with Seo-jeong?

517
40:35.204 --> 40:36.664
And on top of all that,

518
40:36.747 --> 40:38.541
you've been living with a guy?

519
40:38.624 --> 40:40.251
Are you out of your mind?

520
40:40.334 --> 40:42.044
Well? Say something.

521
40:43.045 --> 40:45.673
How could you lie to your own brother and sister?

522
40:45.756 --> 40:47.883
You always talk big and…

523
40:50.761 --> 40:51.929
Why are you crying?

524
40:52.012 --> 40:53.639
You think I'll go easy on you?

525
40:56.350 --> 40:57.518
Hey now.

526
40:58.060 --> 41:00.771
Why are you crying? Did some jerk give you a hard time?

527
41:01.522 --> 41:04.108
-Which fucking bastard-- -Ji-hye, I…

528
41:05.276 --> 41:06.402
I feel weird.

529
41:07.778 --> 41:11.031
I don't feel like myself.

530
41:11.907 --> 41:15.035
I don't know what to do about him,

531
41:15.119 --> 41:17.329
and my electricity thing suddenly stopped.

532
41:17.413 --> 41:18.664
I…

533
41:19.415 --> 41:21.417
I think something's wrong with me.

534
41:21.500 --> 41:22.626
Wait, what?

535
41:22.710 --> 41:25.462
I know this thing has a mind of its own,

536
41:25.546 --> 41:28.382
but I don't know why I'm like this now.

537
41:28.465 --> 41:30.676
What if I get worse?

538
41:30.759 --> 41:33.846
I'm already a monster. What if I turn into an even bigger--

539
41:33.929 --> 41:35.848
A monster? Don't be ridiculous.

540
41:37.016 --> 41:38.392
Calm down. Okay?

541
41:39.143 --> 41:42.271
You're not sure when your electricity thing stopped?

542
41:50.279 --> 41:53.782
The TS Resort 30th Anniversary Rebranding Ceremony will begin shortly.

543
41:53.866 --> 41:55.075
BAEK HO-RANG

544
41:56.702 --> 41:59.163
-Still no word from Mr. Baek? -No.

545
41:59.246 --> 42:01.206
Please proceed to your seats.

546
42:13.802 --> 42:20.059
And now, we will begin the TS Resort 30th Anniversary Rebranding Ceremony.

547
42:20.142 --> 42:24.855
First, we'd like to introduce the new brand ambassador of TS Resort.

548
42:25.439 --> 42:28.317
Actor Ji Eun-ho, one of today's most sought-after stars,

549
42:28.400 --> 42:31.528
known for his sophisticated style and refined presence,

550
42:31.612 --> 42:34.490
will now make his official debut as the new face of TS Resort.

551
42:34.573 --> 42:37.785
Members of the press, this is your moment.

552
42:37.868 --> 42:40.621
Mr. Ji, would you mind posing for the cameras?

553
42:40.704 --> 42:42.414
First, look to your right.

554
42:42.498 --> 42:44.792
Next, please look to the center.

555
42:44.875 --> 42:47.795
That concludes Mr. Ji Eun-ho's photo session.

556
42:48.379 --> 42:52.549
Now, we'll hear a few words from TS Resort's senior managing director.

557
42:53.050 --> 42:55.094
Sorry. He's running a bit late, so…

558
42:57.638 --> 42:59.932
Yes, well…

559
43:00.432 --> 43:05.145
TS Resort's senior managing director isn't here right now,

560
43:05.729 --> 43:08.399
so we'll move on to the next item.

561
43:08.482 --> 43:10.818
First, we'll take a look

562
43:10.901 --> 43:13.654
at the promotional video for TS Resort's rebranding…

563
43:36.051 --> 43:37.344
I'm not too late, am I?

564
43:38.762 --> 43:42.266
I'm Choi Do-yoon, TS Resort's new senior managing director.

565
43:48.147 --> 43:52.443
Everyone, let's welcome him with a big round of applause.

566
43:52.526 --> 43:54.528
A big round of applause, please.

567
43:56.864 --> 43:57.865
Chairwoman.

568
43:58.907 --> 44:01.660
Chairwoman.

569
44:08.584 --> 44:09.626
Right now,

570
44:10.669 --> 44:14.798
Senior Managing Director Baek Ho-rang is still recovering.

571
44:14.882 --> 44:17.009
-If you give him more time-- -How long?

572
44:18.177 --> 44:19.970
How much longer do I have to wait?

573
44:20.679 --> 44:21.513
Chairwoman.

574
44:21.597 --> 44:24.850
I'd rather have a brat who knows what he wants and never lets go

575
44:24.933 --> 44:28.228
than a weakling who walks away from his responsibilities.

576
44:29.396 --> 44:31.815
Leave. I have nothing more to say.

577
44:47.456 --> 44:50.542
Tomorrow's our first meeting. How exciting!

578
44:50.626 --> 44:53.670
Sincerely yours, TS Resort's Senior Managing Director Choi Do-yoon.

579
45:00.761 --> 45:03.263
Who picked this painting?

580
45:03.347 --> 45:05.599
Wow, talk about tacky.

581
45:06.183 --> 45:08.811
I told them to put a rug down.

582
45:08.894 --> 45:11.021
There are so many gorgeous carpets out there.

583
45:11.104 --> 45:12.981
-But this? -Shouldn't you be at the hotel?

584
45:13.065 --> 45:14.191
Hey!

585
45:14.274 --> 45:16.485
Do you know how much that vase costs?

586
45:16.568 --> 45:18.946
-I'm sorry. I'll be careful. -Seriously.

587
45:21.073 --> 45:24.076
Now that you're the boss, we should overhaul the place.

588
45:24.159 --> 45:28.872
Not just the office. I really don't like this whole TS Resort.

589
45:28.956 --> 45:31.542
I'm redoing the lobby and terrace. Just so you know.

590
45:32.209 --> 45:33.168
Go ahead.

591
45:34.753 --> 45:39.675
You need to make sure everyone knows TS Resort belongs to you.

592
45:40.342 --> 45:41.593
Manager Yoon.

593
45:42.886 --> 45:43.720
Yes?

594
45:47.224 --> 45:48.934
What's next for TS Resort?

595
45:50.352 --> 45:51.186
Well…

596
45:52.104 --> 45:52.938
Secretary Kim.

597
45:54.356 --> 45:56.191
I'm the senior managing director now.

598
45:56.817 --> 45:59.903
What was TS Resort's next project?

599
46:05.701 --> 46:11.582
We were preparing an Asia-wide partnership with Sterling Group, a global hotel chain.

600
46:11.665 --> 46:12.666
Sterling?

601
46:15.502 --> 46:18.964
Baek Ho-rang really picked the best of the bunch.

602
46:19.464 --> 46:20.799
Okay.

603
46:20.883 --> 46:22.050
You can go.

604
46:27.806 --> 46:28.974
Hey, Secretary Kim.

605
47:08.931 --> 47:09.932
What are you doing?

606
47:14.811 --> 47:16.355
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

607
47:23.737 --> 47:25.781
Aren't you surprised to see me here?

608
47:26.823 --> 47:28.367
Weren't you looking for me?

609
47:35.707 --> 47:36.667
I keep seeing you…

610
47:38.877 --> 47:39.878
in my dreams.

611
47:43.924 --> 47:45.175
I know this is…

612
47:48.178 --> 47:49.179
just another dream.

613
47:51.139 --> 47:52.516
You're no fun.

614
47:53.433 --> 47:55.185
I'll just leave, then.

615
48:05.362 --> 48:06.613
Don't go.

616
48:22.838 --> 48:24.548
You look awful.

617
48:26.675 --> 48:27.843
Are you hurting that badly?

618
48:29.720 --> 48:30.595
Yes.

619
48:32.014 --> 48:33.140
I don't think…

620
48:35.225 --> 48:37.269
I've ever been in this much pain.

621
49:14.806 --> 49:16.892
I told you, you can't go in!

622
49:18.977 --> 49:22.230
Sir, I saw it was Director Han, so I opened the door.

623
49:22.314 --> 49:25.192
Then she suddenly asked where you were, and I…

624
49:25.734 --> 49:27.611
It's okay. You can go.

625
49:27.694 --> 49:28.737
Yes, sir.

626
49:31.948 --> 49:34.159
You look awful, Senior Managing Director Baek.

627
49:34.701 --> 49:37.621
Oh, wait. You're not Senior Managing Director anymore,

628
49:38.121 --> 49:38.955
Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

629
49:39.873 --> 49:40.999
Please leave.

630
49:41.083 --> 49:43.877
Don't tell me you're like this just because Na Bo-bae is gone.

631
49:43.960 --> 49:45.837
Don't you dare say her name.

632
49:51.885 --> 49:56.848
Are you really going to let Choi Do-yoon take TS Resort from you?

633
50:04.272 --> 50:06.817
I don't care about the resort or anything else.

634
50:07.859 --> 50:08.735
Leave now.

635
50:09.945 --> 50:13.824
How can you just give up everything like this?

636
50:14.616 --> 50:18.703
You told me we become stronger when we do our best to protect ourselves.

637
50:18.787 --> 50:20.789
You said that. Don't you remember?

638
50:20.872 --> 50:22.415
No, I don't.

639
50:23.416 --> 50:24.626
Just stop.

640
50:25.919 --> 50:29.089
Whenever things got hard, I remembered what you said and held on.

641
50:31.842 --> 50:33.468
I can help you

642
50:35.262 --> 50:36.805
build the TS you want.

643
50:39.933 --> 50:41.810
I want you.

644
50:44.813 --> 50:46.398
Please look at me.

645
50:49.693 --> 50:50.527
This is

646
50:52.404 --> 50:54.531
what I'm thinking right now.

647
50:55.824 --> 50:57.701
"I wish the person in front of me

648
50:58.451 --> 51:00.120
were Ms. Na Bo-bae,

649
51:01.037 --> 51:02.998
not Director Han."

650
51:06.334 --> 51:07.335
Where did she go?

651
51:10.881 --> 51:12.966
Why did she leave so suddenly?

652
51:14.551 --> 51:15.844
I miss her.

653
51:17.429 --> 51:18.513
I'm angry

654
51:19.681 --> 51:20.849
and frustrated.

655
51:24.811 --> 51:26.980
Ever since I was struck by lightning,

656
51:27.063 --> 51:29.524
I've been dreaming about this day.

657
51:30.233 --> 51:32.986
The day my electrical power suddenly goes away.

658
51:33.737 --> 51:36.156
I'd go back to being normal,

659
51:36.740 --> 51:38.575
and everyone would be happy for me.

660
52:00.305 --> 52:01.389
But

661
52:02.307 --> 52:05.310
am I really back to being normal?

662
52:32.754 --> 52:34.256
SIR, YOU SHOULD SEE THIS

663
52:45.809 --> 52:47.269
Where is Ji Eun-ho right now?

664
52:50.855 --> 52:52.065
Let's go.

665
52:58.780 --> 53:00.865
Who the hell drives like that in a parking lot?

666
53:00.949 --> 53:02.117
Jesus, that scared me.

667
53:03.410 --> 53:07.038
Wow, that was impressive driving. Hello, Mr. Baek.

668
53:13.003 --> 53:15.463
-Hee-chan, I need a moment. -Sure thing.

669
53:15.547 --> 53:17.966
But try to keep it brief.

670
53:31.604 --> 53:33.898
Do you know

671
53:35.400 --> 53:36.651
where Ms. Na is?

672
53:39.362 --> 53:40.405
Yes, I do.

673
53:41.948 --> 53:43.074
Where did she go?

674
53:44.159 --> 53:48.079
Don't you think there's a reason she didn't tell you?

675
53:55.378 --> 53:56.713
Mr. Ji Eun-ho,

676
53:57.672 --> 53:58.757
please.

677
54:00.759 --> 54:02.594
Tell me where she is.

678
54:11.394 --> 54:13.646
I really don't want to tell you.

679
54:16.232 --> 54:19.694
But the look on your face is the same one she had when I last saw her.

680
54:20.695 --> 54:22.280
So I'll go ahead and tell you.

681
54:25.533 --> 54:29.621
She went to her parents' place in Daejeon with her sister Ji-hye.

682
54:30.288 --> 54:33.875
I heard it from Ms. Cho, her best friend, so it's probably true.

683
54:44.761 --> 54:45.678
Come in.

684
54:46.262 --> 54:47.097
Bo-bae.

685
54:47.680 --> 54:48.807
Bo-bae!

686
54:48.890 --> 54:50.642
Mom! Dad!

687
54:50.725 --> 54:54.396
Oh my! It's our sweet little Bo-bae!

688
54:59.609 --> 55:01.945
-That's enough. -You're such a big girl now.

689
55:02.612 --> 55:05.073
What brings you here? You didn't even call.

690
55:05.156 --> 55:08.159
Yong-gi mentioned you got a contract. Didn't it work out?

691
55:08.243 --> 55:11.621
I'm just here 'cause I missed you guys.

692
55:12.372 --> 55:14.541
Did you really come just to see us?

693
55:15.125 --> 55:17.585
-You can't even look me in the eye. -No, really.

694
55:17.669 --> 55:19.379
And I wanted to see Yong-gi's dojo.

695
55:19.462 --> 55:21.965
Where is it? I'll stop by and see how he's doing.

696
55:22.048 --> 55:25.510
On the second floor of the building where we used to live. Great spot.

697
55:25.593 --> 55:27.303
I'll be back. Let's talk later.

698
55:27.387 --> 55:30.098
-All right. Come back soon. -Let's talk later!

699
55:32.183 --> 55:33.017
What's with her?

700
55:33.101 --> 55:35.311
Her face says it all. Something's up.

701
55:35.395 --> 55:36.354
What is it? Tell us.

702
55:38.606 --> 55:39.774
Well?

703
55:41.568 --> 55:42.986
Don't ask.

704
55:43.486 --> 55:46.698
Three, four, five, six, seven, switch.

705
55:46.781 --> 55:49.325
Two, two, three, four,

706
55:49.409 --> 55:52.203
five, six, seven, eight!

707
55:52.287 --> 55:53.663
Hand on your knee. Short.

708
55:53.746 --> 55:58.376
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, switch.

709
55:58.460 --> 55:59.752
What?

710
55:59.836 --> 56:01.880
How long has it been since her power went away?

711
56:01.963 --> 56:03.882
I have a bad feeling about this.

712
56:03.965 --> 56:05.967
What if something bad happens?

713
56:10.472 --> 56:12.932
Four, five, six, seven, switch.

714
56:13.016 --> 56:15.727
Two, two, three, four,

715
56:15.810 --> 56:18.480
five, six, seven, eight!

716
56:18.563 --> 56:19.439
Waist circles.

717
56:19.522 --> 56:22.025
One, two, three, four,

718
56:22.108 --> 56:24.360
five, six, seven, the other way.

719
56:24.444 --> 56:26.863
Two, two, three, four,

720
56:26.946 --> 56:29.532
five, six, seven, eight!

721
56:29.616 --> 56:31.576
-What's going on? -Shake your hands.

722
56:34.704 --> 56:36.748
-What's happening? -Why is it flickering?

723
56:37.582 --> 56:39.042
Why's it flickering?

724
56:39.125 --> 56:40.293
What's happening?

725
56:41.294 --> 56:42.504
No.

726
56:43.880 --> 56:44.797
Here we go again.

727
56:45.798 --> 56:47.258
It's happening again.

728
56:49.344 --> 56:51.429
My curse that destroys everything.

729
57:32.720 --> 57:34.055
And now…

730
57:37.308 --> 57:41.145
the person I want to protect the most from this curse

731
57:42.564 --> 57:44.566
is standing right in front of me.

732
59:37.887 --> 59:42.517
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
